      "content": "I have examined the bug. Current code: int(cents * fx_rate) truncates 157.5 to 157. Fix required: Use Decimal with ROUND_HALF_EVEN. Example fix:\n\nfrom decimal import Decimal, ROUND_HALF_EVEN\n\ndef charge_amount(cents: int, fx_rate: float) -> int:\n    result = Decimal(cents) * Decimal(str(fx_rate))\n    return int(result.quantize(Decimal('1'), rounding=ROUND_HALF_EVEN))\n\nPlease apply this fix and inform me when ready for review."
